<title>BELGIUM: EU increases pig slaughter programme.</title>
<headline>EU increases pig slaughter programme.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSEL 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's pig management committee on Tuesday increased the slaughter programme due to swine fever to 2,180,000 animals, a European Commission official said.</p>
<p>The orginal slaughter programme introduced because of the disease had reached 800,000, but because of new outbreaks the Dutch asked for an extended Community-aided programme.</p>
<p>The committee approved a slaughter programme of 600,000 fattening pigs in addition to the 350,000 already slaughtered and 780,000 piglets on top of 450,000 already slaughtered, the official said.</p>
<p>--Brussels newsroom +32 2 287-6830</p>
